{"id":"cuidado","lemma":"cuidado","pos":"noun","rank":276,"glosses":["care (close attention; concern)","care (maintenance, upkeep)","care (the treatment of those in need)"],"ipa":"/kwiˈdado/","gender":"m","forms":{"plural":"cuidados"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/e/e3/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Marreromarco-cuidado.wav","examples":[{"text":"¡Cuidado con el perro!","en":"Beware of the dog!","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/39677"},{"text":"Los niños estaban bien cuidados.","en":"The children were well looked after.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/932189"},{"text":"Cuidado con las abejas.","en":"Look out for bees.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/58035"},{"text":"Ella prestó cuidados a su herida.","en":"She took care of his wound."},{"text":"Tenemos que tener cuidado.","en":"We must be careful.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/459134"}]}